WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.859 --> 00:00:08.210
Hafnium is, I think, an element to watch.
At the moment, it does not have many uses

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:21.270
but there is a strong opinion that hafnium
is going to be used in making layers on computer

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:29.250
chips like this, and that hafnium oxide will
have better properties than some of the other

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.340
oxides that are used. So I think that hafnium
is certainly something that’s way up on

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:39.570
the charts and soon may be much higher than
its existing number on the periodic table

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.800
 - in the elements popularity.

